---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Prose title="Corrections policy" description={`How to report an error on ${SITE.name} and how we fix it.`} path="corrections/">
  <p>If something in a guide is wrong or out of date, we want to know.</p>
  <h2>How to report</h2>
  <p>Use the "Report an error" link at the bottom of any guide, or email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> with the page link, what is wrong, and, if possible, the official source that shows the correct information.</p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We check the report against the official source.</li>
    <li>If the guide is wrong, we fix it, update its "last checked" date, and add a short correction note at the end of the guide saying what changed.</li>
    <li>If a rule has changed, we update the guide and mention the change.</li>
  </ul>
</Prose>
